== asal terdaftar ==
Allow-Origin : https://situs-saya.id
Vary         : Origin
Credentials  : true
== asal asing ==
Allow-Origin : (tidak ada)
status       : 200
== tanpa header Origin (bukan lintas asal) ==
Allow-Origin : (tidak ada)
== preflight OPTIONS ==
status       : 204
Allow-Methods: GET, HEAD, POST, PUT, PATCH, DELETE, OPTIONS
Allow-Headers: Content-Type, X-CSRF-Token
Max-Age      : 600
== preflight asal asing ==
status       : 405
== cors('*') ditolak ==
ditolak seperti seharusnya
== alamat klien ==
proxy + XFF        : 1.2.3.4
rantai XFF         : 1.2.3.4
XFF dipalsukan     : 8.8.8.8
tanpa XFF          : 127.0.0.1
== aman secara bawaan ==
XFF tanpa izin     : 8.8.8.8
== soket_alamat_peer ==
alamat peer        : 127.0.0.1
